            "An account whose verified email is listed in APP_ADMIN_EMAILS is created super admin at its first sign-in. All others are created “pending” and see nothing until a super admin activates them. As a fallback: bin/console app:user:promote <email>, or the password admin account.",
            "The GitHub OAuth app also serves the connectors: on a “GitHub (code and history)” connector, the “Connect with GitHub” button asks for access to the repositories (repo scope) and stores the encrypted token in the database, instead of a token set in the environment variables.",
